{"id": "q0374", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 4.74, "n_chunks": 5, "n_concurrent": 5, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.5793, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": "GREAT DANE", "query": "What breed of dog is Marmaduke in the newspaper cartoon strip of that name?", "transcript": "What breed of dog is Marmaduke in the newspaper cartoon strip of that name?", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Marmaduke is a Great Dane.", "expert_answer": "Marmaduke is a **Great Dane**.", "expert_latency_s": 1.24, "stall_ms": 32, "relay_ms": 333}
{"id": "q0385", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.45, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2981, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": "Toy", "query": "What is a Jacob's Ladder?", "transcript": "What is a Jacob's Ladder?", "mode": "local", "answer": "A Jacob's ladder is a type of electronic device used to detect and measure voltage levels. It typically consists of two metal rods that are connected to a power source, forming a series of electrical steps or \"ladder rungs.\" When the voltage increases, the sparks between the rods move upward along the ladder. This visual display helps electricians safely work with high voltages by indicating the approximate level of voltage present.", "answer_ms": 2731}
{"id": "q0391", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.15, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1704, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": "Percy LeBaron Spencer", "query": "Who invented the microwave oven in 1945?", "transcript": "Who invented the microwave oven in nineteen forty five?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The microwave oven was invented by Percy Spencer in 1945.", "answer_ms": 454}
{"id": "q0405", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 2.04, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1578, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": null, "query": "How many months have 28 days?", "transcript": "How many months have twenty eight days?", "mode": "local", "answer": "All twelve months have at least twenty-eight days.", "answer_ms": 317}
{"id": "q0414", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 5.67, "n_chunks": 6, "n_concurrent": 6, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.0824, "eot_read_ms": 27, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Imagine you are the last person on Earth. Write a diary entry describing your thoughts and feelings.", "transcript": "Imagine you are the last person on Earth. Write a diary entry describing your thoughts and feelings.", "mode": "local", "answer": "Dear Diary, Today the sun came up like it always does, warm and steady, painting the sky in soft pinks and golds. I walked down to the riverbank as usual, the water flowing over smooth stones, making little gurgling sounds that remind me of laughter. The air smells like damp earth and something sweet—maybe wildflowers? I sat on my favorite rock for a while, just watching the ripples spread out across the water. It’s quiet here, but not lonely. I think about all the people who used to live nearby, their voices and footsteps echoing now only in my memories. Sometimes I wonder what they would say if they saw this valley today—would they recognize it? Would they feel peace too? I miss talking with others, sharing stories and secrets. But then again, maybe solitude is its own kind of gift. The world feels different without so many eyes upon it. I’ve learned to listen more closely—to the wind through the trees, to the birds singing from high up in the pines, to the steady beat of my own heart. There’s beauty in simplicity, in stillness. As evening falls, the sky turns into a tapestry of oranges and purples. I’ll light a small fire tonight, roast some roots I found near the woods, and watch the stars come out one by one. It’s just me, but it’s enough. For now, this quiet life suits me. Until tomorrow, when the sun rises again. Yours truly, [Your Name Here].", "answer_ms": 10282}
{"id": "q0424", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 2.42, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2625, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Give me some examples of metamorphic rocks.", "transcript": "Give me some examples of metamorphic rocks.", "mode": "local", "answer": "Metamorphic rocks are formed when existing rocks change due to heat, pressure, or chemica", "answer_ms": 560}
{"id": "q0435", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.98, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.275, "eot_read_ms": 27, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Who are the top NFL Quarterbacks?", "transcript": "Who are the top NFL quarterbacks?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The top NFL quarterbacks can vary depending on the season, performance metrics, and criteria used, but as of recent seasons, some consistently considered among the best include Patrick Mahomes, Josh Allen, Aaron Rodgers, Tom Brady, and Jalen Hurts. These players have demonstrated elite skill, leadership, and success in leading their teams to victories and playoff runs. Rankings often depend on statistics like passing yards, touchdowns, efficiency ratings, and postseason performance.", "answer_ms": 2687}
{"id": "q0447", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 1.94, "n_chunks": 2, "n_concurrent": 2, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2871, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Can I run MacOS on a Windows PC?", "transcript": "Can I run Mac OS on a Windows PC?", "mode": "local", "answer": "You can run Mac OS on a Windows PC?", "answer_ms": 305}
{"id": "q0459", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.27, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1793, "eot_read_ms": 26, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are some basic spirits you should have at your bar", "transcript": "What are some basic spirits you should have at your bar?", "mode": "local", "answer": "To build a strong foundation, start with neutral base spirits like neutral grain whiskey or vodka. These are great for mixing because they don't overpower other ingredients. Then add some classic flavored options like bourbon or rum to give you variety without being too complex. Once those basics are covered, you can experiment with more unique or rare spirits as your menu grows.", "answer_ms": 2077}
{"id": "q0463", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 2.49, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2477, "eot_read_ms": 28, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Does Las Vegas have a professional hockey team?", "transcript": "Does Las Vegas have a professional hockey team?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Yes, Las Vegas has a professional hockey team! The Vegas Golden Knights joined the NHL in 2017 and have become a popular team in the league.", "answer_ms": 905}
{"id": "q0471", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 3.49, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.4505, "eot_read_ms": 23, "reference_answer": null, "query": "Write a brief summary of Nezami Ganjavi's Layli and Majnun.", "transcript": "Nizami Ganjavi's Layli and Majnun.", "mode": "escalated", "relay": "Nizami Ganjavi's *Layli and Majnun*, finished around 1188, is part of his celebrated Khamsa. It's a Persian retelling of the ancient tale of Qays and Layli—a tragic love story where forbidden passion leads to spiritual longing and madness. Nizami’s version became hugely influential in Persian literature and beyond, shaping how this legendary romance was told for centuries.", "expert_answer": "**Nizami Ganjavi’s *Layli and Majnun*** is a 12th-century Persian narrative poem, completed around **1188**, and is one of the five works in Nizami’s famous **Khamsa** (“Quintet”).\n\nIt retells the tragic Arabian love story of **Qays** and **Layli**. Qays falls deeply in love with Layli, but their families prevent their marriage. Overcome by grief and obsession, Qays becomes known as **Majnun**, meaning “madman” or “possessed.” The poem explores themes of **ideal love, spiritual longing, social constraint, madness, and mystical devotion**.\n\nNizami’s version transformed the older Arabic legend into a highly refined Persian romance and became the most influential literary treatment of the story, inspiring later poets, painters, musicians, and writers across Persian, Turkish, Urdu, and other literary traditions.", "expert_latency_s": 6.3, "stall_ms": 30, "relay_ms": 2547}
{"id": "q0484", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 2.77, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1253, "eot_read_ms": 27, "reference_answer": null, "query": "电动汽车是智能交通的未来。", "transcript": "电动汽车是智能交通的未来。", "mode": "local", "answer": "电动汽车是智能交通的未来。", "answer_ms": 223}
